[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11962.269, "timestamp": "03:19:22", "text": "你們說話。是的，我在跟我的族人說話，他們好像聽不到我說話。呃，好的好的，對不起，對不起。我們走吧，我們走吧，我們走吧。你在說你腦子裡的聲音嗎？我腦子裡的聲音？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11982.308, "timestamp": "03:19:42", "author": "@Roku-rin", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8LlS_C2IirDMfA5r2V0q5G1kudp8dmG6RQvz_jCAUT3H-esyEgTNPDwrfCXiyX7Undc9UmHNgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"The way you make a family is not family friendly\""}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11985.637, "timestamp": "03:19:45", "author": "@Roku-rin", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8LlS_C2IirDMfA5r2V0q5G1kudp8dmG6RQvz_jCAUT3H-esyEgTNPDwrfCXiyX7Undc9UmHNgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "till we meet again"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11988.309, "timestamp": "03:19:48", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11990.75, "timestamp": "03:19:50", "text": "沒錯。 C，你現在需要睡覺。你在幹什麼？如果你看到任何動物，就告訴我，我會拿些免費的食物來吃我們。 Su，下來吧，下來吧。 Joy，下來吧。但是我們沒有食物。我，我會弄些食物的，別擔心，我會弄些食物的，別擔心，我有一些食物。你有嗎？你有嗎？"}]